OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity to close its theatre
OL,4,Aafter 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre that was opened by celebrated
OL,7,Fplaywright Sir Alan Ayckbourn has
OL,8,Fannounced its closure days before its
OL,9,F50th anniversary.
OL,11,FTheatre in the Mill on the University
OL,12,Fof Bradford campus opened in November
OL,13,F1976, but will close permanently in
OL,14,FMarch.
OL,16,FThe 100-capacity venue has been facing
OL,17,F"significant financial pressures"
OL,18,Faccording to the university, which said
OL,19,Fit wanted to focus its resources "where
OL,20,Fthey can have the greatest impact on
OL,21,Fstudents, teaching and research".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
